00:54:05.090 --> 00:54:07.590 align:middle line:84%
In fact, there's two other
functions that come with strings.

00:54:07.590 --> 00:54:10.560 align:middle line:84%
One is called L strip, the
other is called R strip,

00:54:10.560 --> 00:54:12.378 align:middle line:90%
that allow you to do one or the other.

00:54:12.378 --> 00:54:14.670 align:middle line:84%
If we want to start getting
rid of space in the middle,

00:54:14.670 --> 00:54:17.760 align:middle line:84%
